<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Social Media</title>
  <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/materialize/1.0.0/css/materialize.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/icon?family=Material+Icons" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="/css/styles.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="app-nav">
    <div class="nav-wrapper container">
      <a href="/" class="brand-logo">Social Media</a>
      <a href="/posts" class="right nav-link">Publicaciones</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="container home-page">
    <section class="hero-panel">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow"><i class="material-icons tiny">auto_awesome</i> TU ESPACIO DIGITAL</span>
        <h1>Comparte tus ideas<br>con el mundo</h1>
        <p>Crea, organiza y administra tus publicaciones desde un solo lugar.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/posts" class="btn btn-primary waves-effect waves-light">
            <i class="material-icons left">explore</i>Explorar publicaciones
          </a>
          <a href="/posts/new" class="btn-flat btn-secondary waves-effect">
            <i class="material-icons left">add_circle_outline</i>Crear publicación
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div>
        <div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
        <div class="hero-icon"><i class="material-icons">forum</i></div>
        <div class="floating-card card-one"><i class="material-icons">favorite</i><span>Ideas</span></div>
        <div class="floating-card card-two"><i class="material-icons">send</i><span>Conecta</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="feature-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span>TODO EN UN SOLO LUGAR</span>
        <h2>Una forma simple de compartir</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="row feature-row">
        <div class="col s12 m4">
          <article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon blue-accent"><i class="material-icons">edit_note</i></div><h3>Publica</h3><p>Comparte contenido con otros usuarios.</p></article>
        </div>
        <div class="col s12 m4">
          <article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon violet-accent"><i class="material-icons">folder_open</i></div><h3>Organiza</h3><p>Administra tus publicaciones fácilmente.</p></article>
        </div>
        <div class="col s12 m4">
          <article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon teal-accent"><i class="material-icons">groups</i></div><h3>Conecta</h3><p>Visualiza contenido asociado a diferentes usuarios.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
